# Testing

Details and current status: `ai/TESTING.md`.

- Backend: `cd backend; .\mvnw.cmd test`. Frontend: `cd frontend; npm run lint; npm run build`.
- Unit tests use Mockito; web/security tests use `@WebMvcTest` importing `SecurityConfig`, `JwtService`,
  `RestSecurityHandlers`, `ApiErrorWriter` with `TestProperties.JWT_SECRET`.
- Integration tests use Testcontainers (`disabledWithoutDocker = true`); never the dev DB `RagDB`.
- No paid AI calls; use `support/FakeAiModels`, `HashingEmbedder`, `InMemoryEmbeddingStore`.
- Report only tests actually executed, with counts; record results and known failures in `ai/TESTING.md`.
